<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><b>보낸 사람:</b> Seung Bin Oh &lt;seungbinoh@microsoft.com&gt;<br><b>보냄:</b> 2026 7월 30, 목요일 11:20<br><b>받는 사람:</b> 홍종현(MSSP SRE팀) &lt;jonghyun.hong@kt.com&gt;; External - supportmail-PROD &lt;supportmail@techsupport.microsoft.com&gt;<br><b>참조:</b> Keehoon Kim (Kenneth) &lt;Kenneth.Kim@microsoft.com&gt;; Jay Park &lt;parkjay@microsoft.com&gt;; Yongha Hwang &lt;yonghahwang@microsoft.com&gt;; 조용탁(MSSP SRE팀) &lt;yongtak.cho@kt.com&gt;<br><b>제목:</b> RE: WAF - TrackingID#2607280030004851 </div><div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><img id=\"x__x0000_i1060\" width=\"690\" height=\"78\" size=\"5006\" data-outlook-trace=\"F:1|T:1\" src=\"cid:image001.jpg@01DD2015.24377840\" data-attachment-id=\"5a038c37-a683-4b25-a5c5-67a2d7df0016\" style=\"width:7.1944in; height:0.8125in; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px\"></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">홍종현 매니저님 안녕하세요.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">Microsoft Azure 기술지원팀 오승빈입니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">현재의 DRS Ruleset에 신규 managed rule이 추가는 아주 예외적인 경우에만 발생하며</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">2022년 SpringShell CEV와 같은 심각한 취약점 발견 등과 같은 심각도에서만 진행됩니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:blue\"><a href=\"https://protect2.fireeye.com/v1/url?k=1fb2e39a-7ce58e52-1fb3c8e4-74fe486eb97a-47e253ded1557fdf&amp;q=1&amp;e=0cd1ceed-c7d2-4098-a988-af97d3380db0&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.microsoft.com%2Fen-us%2Fsecurity%2Fblog%2F2022%2F04%2F04%2Fspringshell-rce-vulnerability-guidance-for-protecting-against-and-detecting-cve-2022-22965%2F\" id=\"OWA2716e53a-4deb-1574-86b7-b19fd7bf2156\" class=\"OWAAutoLink\" data-auth=\"NotApplicable\" style=\"color:blue; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px\"><u>SpringShell RCE vulnerability: Guidance for protecting against and detecting CVE-2022-22965 | Microsoft Security Blog</u></a></span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">CVE-2022-22965를 차단하는 Rule의 경우</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><img id=\"x_Picture_x0020_1\" width=\"758\" height=\"847\" size=\"659800\" data-outlook-trace=\"F:1|T:1\" src=\"cid:image002.png@01DD2015.647C9070\" data-attachment-id=\"0e2c72d3-7edd-47b8-ab8e-83c9e962246d\" style=\"width:7.9027in; height:8.8333in; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px\"></span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">AppGw WAF정책에는 Enable 상태로 Managed rule이 추가되었기 때문에</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">( 해당 시점에는 WAF engine이 현재 버전과 달라 Enable 상태가 현재 WAF engine의 anomaly scoring과 동일합니다.)</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">말씀하신 것과 같이 추가된 Rule로 false positive가 발생하는 상황이 가능 했습니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">다만, 심각한 취약점에 사용되는 패턴을 포함한 요청이기 때문에 client쪽에서도 주의가 필요합니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">혹시 이외 더 추가적&#51004;로 궁금하신 사항 있&#51004;시면</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">연락 부탁드리겠습니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">감사합니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><b>오승빈 Seung Bin Oh</b></span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><b>Azure Networking Technical Support </b>| Support Engineer</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">Microsoft Korea | Office: +82 2 531 4728 | E-mail: </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:blue\"><a href=\"mailto:seungbinoh@microsoftsupport.com\" id=\"OWA7e3b8309-5ec6-3c8a-e703-f652f9871815\" class=\"OWAAutoLink\" style=\"color:blue; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px\"><u>seungbinoh@microsoft.com</u></a></span></p><p sty