rgin-bottom:0px\"><u>https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2021/12/11/guidance-for-preventing-detecting-and-hunting-for-cve-2021-44228-log4j-2-exploitation/</u></a></span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">Microsoft 공식 Log4j 관련 블로그 포스팅에서도 대응 방법&#51004;로 소개되어 있습니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">Portal 표시 오류에 대한 부분은 담당팀에 &#54588;드백 전달하여 빠른 시일 내에 수정될 수 있도록 하겠습니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">A2.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">처음 메일 답변에서 안내 드린 것과 같이</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">949110 에 의한 block 이 WAF 로그에서 확인되면,</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\">&nbsp;</p><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:rgb(31,31,31); width:365.35pt; box-sizing:border-box; border-collapse:collapse; border-spacing:0px\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:0.4pt; vertical-align:top\"><p style=\"margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:9.5pt; color:white\">TransactionId</span></p></td><td style=\"padding:0.4pt; vertical-align:top\"><p style=\"margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:9.5pt; color:white\">string</span></p></td><td style=\"padding:0.4pt; vertical-align:top\"><p style=\"margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:9.5pt; color:white\">Unique ID for a given transaction which helps group multiple rule violations that occurred within the same request.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:blue\"><a href=\"https://protect2.fireeye.com/v1/url?k=aaea5a35-c9bd37fd-aaeb714b-74fe486eb97a-be5dd35c84b34604&amp;q=1&amp;e=ba214217-a4aa-49a2-9f50-c72a22756602&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Flearn.microsoft.com%2Fen-us%2Fazure%2Fazure-monitor%2Freference%2Ftables%2Fagwfirewalllogs\" id=\"OWA9b7f76d3-75da-ab5f-4539-61aec7e530c2\" class=\"OWAAutoLink\" data-auth=\"NotApplicable\" style=\"color:blue; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px\"><u>https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-monitor/reference/tables/agwfirewalllogs</u></a></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">해당 로그에 기록된&nbsp; TranscationId를 기준&#51004;로</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">WAF log를 조회 하여 해당 트래픽이 matched 된 Rule들을 조회할 수 있기 때문에</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">해당 트래픽이 어떤 어떤 Rule들에 탐지되어 anomaly score가 5이상이 되었는지 확인 가능합니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">즉, 한번의 요청에 대해 WAF log는 여러 개가 생성되며</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">Anomaly score에 의해 block 되는 트래픽에 대한 로그는 949110 &#51004;로 합산되어 표시되지 않습니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">한 개의 TranscationId 당 anomaly score 5이상 전 탐지된 모든 rule의 log들이</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">개별적&#51004;로 로그 되며 score 5이상 시 949110이 추가로 기록되는 방식입니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">Rule의 명칭은 Microsoft_DefaultRuleSet-2.2-BLOCKING-EVALUATION-949110 &#51004;로</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">Portal의 managed rule 목록에서는 표시되지 않고</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">WAF log에서만 확인 가능하며,</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">공식 문서에 설명되어 있습니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"><img id=\"x_x_Picture_x0020_1\" width=\"942\" height=\"241\" size=\"51790\" data-outlook-trace=\"F:1|T:1\" src=\"cid:image006.png@01DD2015.24377840\" data-attachment-id=\"186aff02-1043-4de5-a176-06a44efbaeb6\" style=\"width:9.8194in; height:2.5208in; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"color:blue\"><a href=\"https://protect2.fireeye.com/v1/url?k=15fcb7d4-76abda1c-15fd9caa-74fe486eb97a-e1c26b1884da6b64&amp;q=1&amp;e=0cd1ceed-c7d2-4098-a988-af97d3380db0&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Flearn.microsoft.com%2Fen-us%2Fazure%2Fweb-application-firewall%2Fag%2Fapplication-gateway-crs-rulegroups-rules%3Ftabs%3Ddrs22%252Cowasp32%23drs99032-22\" id=\"OWA25c2f4a0-46e0-1a14-de74-cba9210c9396\" class=\"OWAAutoLink\" data-auth=\"NotApplicable\" style=\"color:blue; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px\"><u>CRS and DRS rule groups and rules - Azure Web Application Firewall | Microsoft Learn</u></a></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">혹시</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">이외</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">더</span> <span st