;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">그리고 Log4j(2021-44228)의 경우는 DRS CVE 룰에 확인되지 않는데 대응이 안되는 것인지 확인부탁드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:9pt; color:black\"><b>[CVE 룰(CRS)]</b></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"><img id=\"x_x_x_image_0\" width=\"1503\" height=\"228\" size=\"247209\" data-outlook-trace=\"F:1|T:1\" src=\"cid:image015.png@01DD2015.24377840\" data-attachment-id=\"bd32cc7c-24b2-4bf3-bf50-b0adc28c4a3d\" style=\"width:15.6597in; height:2.3819in; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"><b>2. Action=Log Rule의 Anomaly Score 동작 확인</b></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">요청 기준&#51004;로만 점수가 산정되는 것 확인했습니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">로그가 어떻게 찍히는지 예시와 함께 부탁드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">ex) 1번룰 점수 2 2번 점수 3 인경우</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1번 룰 blocked</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2번 룰 blocked</span></p><div id=\"x_x_x_Signature\"><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">Log 일때는 1번룰 Log 이렇게 로깅이 되는지?</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"><b>3. DRS룰의 경우, CRS룰과 달리 스코어링을 통해서 적용되며, 점수 조절도 불가능한 것&#51004;로 안내받았었습니다.&nbsp;</b></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp; 현재 DRS 룰 확인 시, 모두 Block이 가능하고 모두 Anomaly Score가 가능한것&#51004;로 보입니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp; 말씀주신대로 CRS와 동일하게 Block/Log 운영시에 제한사항이 없는지 다시 한번 확인 부탁드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><div id=\"x_x_x_Signature\"><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:9pt; color:black\"><b>[아래 이미지 참고]</b></span></p></div><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"><img id=\"x_x_x_image_1\" width=\"1219\" height=\"340\" size=\"581080\" data-outlook-trace=\"F:1|T:1\" src=\"cid:image014.p