mily:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">제가 잘 못 이해한 부분이나</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">확인이 필요한 사항이 있&#51004;시면 언제든지 문의주시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><b>[</b></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><b>문의사항</b></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><b>]</b></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">Azure WAF DRS rule에 관한 문의</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Batang,serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">안녕하세요</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">DRS </span><span style=\"font-family:Batang,serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">전환</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Batang,serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">과정</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Batang,serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">검토</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Batang,serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">중</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Batang,serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">확인</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Batang,serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">필요한</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Batang,serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">사항에</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Batang,serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">대해</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Batang,serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">문의드립니다</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">​​​​​​​</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><b>[</b></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><b>확인사항</b></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><b>]</b></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">1. 800xxx CVE Rule 확인</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">DRS에서 해당 800xxx CVE Rule이 삭제 된걸로 보이는데 제거가 된 것인지, 다른 Rule로 대체된 것인지 및 매핑 관계 확인 요청(주요 취약점대응 룰로 오탐률이 적은 룰)</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">→ 정확하게 어떤 Rule인지 확인 부탁 드리겠습니다. Rule ID 혹은 상세 설명 부탁 드리겠습니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">800xxx CVE Rule 로는 정보가 확인되지 않습니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">2. DRS 2.2 존재하는 Rule ID 921421 에 대한 정보 확인.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">공식 문서에 Rule ID 921421에 대한 상세 설명이 없어 탐지 조건 및 동작 방식 확인 요청.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">→ </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:blue\"><a href=\"https://protect2.fireeye.com/v1/url?k=ef7e9919-8c29f4d1-ef7fb267-74fe486eb97a-17b241708178157b&amp;q=1&amp;e=ba214217-a4aa-49a2-9f50-c72a22756602&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fcoreruleset%2Fcoreruleset%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Frules%2FREQUEST-921-PROTOCOL-ATTACK.conf\" id=\"OWA05565f1c-1cf5-51fb-b750-6340435f1014\" class=\"OWAAutoLink\" data-auth=\"NotApplicable\" style=\"color:blue; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px\"><u>https://github.com/coreruleset/coreruleset/blob/main/rules/REQUEST-921-PROTOCOL-ATTACK.conf</u></a></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">#</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"># -=[ Body Processor Bypass ]=-</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">#</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"># [ Rule Logic ]</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">#</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-fami