 UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"># &nbsp; crs-toolchain regex update 921421</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">#</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">SecRule REQUEST_HEADERS:Content-Type &quot;@rx ^[^\\s\\x0b,;]+[\\s\\x0b,;].*?(?:application/(?:.+\\+)?json|(?:application/(?:soap\\+)?|text/)xml)&quot; \\</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;id:921421,\\</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp;phase:1,\\</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp;block,\\</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp;capture,\\</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp;t:none,t:lowercase,\\</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp;msg:'Content-Type header: Dangerous content type outside the mime type declaration',\\</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Se