font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp;ver:'OWASP_CRS/4.29.0-dev',\\</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp;severity:'CRITICAL',\\</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp;setvar:'tx.inbound_anomaly_score_pl1=+%{tx.critical_anomaly_score}'&quot;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">OWASP CRS 기반 Rule의 경우 위 OWASP CRS 공식 Github 링크에서 각 rule의 상세 정보 확인이 가능합니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">3. Action=Log Rule의 Anomaly Score 동작 확인</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">Action이 Log인 Rule도 Anomaly Score에 누적되는지, 누적 범위가 동일 요청(Transaction) 기준인지 시간(Time) 기준&#51004;로도 누적되는사항이 있는지, 어떻게 로그 기록이 되는지 상세 내용 확인 요청.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">→ Action : Anomaly score은 한개의 transaction을 기준&#51004;로 누적됩니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:rgb(31,31,31); width:365.35pt; box-sizing:border-box; border-collapse:collapse; border-spacing:0px\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:0.4pt; vertical-align:top\"><p style=\"margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:9.5pt; color:white\">TransactionId</span></p></td><td style=\"padding:0.4pt; vertical-align:top\"><p style=\"margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:9.5pt; color:white\">string</span></p></td><td style=\"padding:0.4pt; vertical-align:top\"><p style=\"margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:9.5pt; color:white\">Unique ID for a given transaction which helps group multiple rule violations that occurred within the same request.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:blue\"><a href=\"https://protect2.fireeye.com/v1/url?k=aaea5a35-c9bd37fd-aaeb714b-74fe486eb97a-be5dd35c84b34604&amp;q=1&amp;e=ba214217-a4aa-49a2-9f50-c72a22756602&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Flearn.microsoft.com%2Fen-us%2Fazure%2Fazure-monitor%2Freference%2Ftables%2Fagwfirewalllogs\" id=\"OWA05d73d22-e579-59df-0b23-10b331885d64\" class=\"OWAAutoLink\" data-auth=\"NotApplicable\" style=\"color:blue; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px\"><u>https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-monitor/reference/tables/agwfirewalllogs</u></a></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">WAF log에서 trasnsactionid를 기준&#51004;로 로그 검색 시</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">하나의 transaction에 대해 탐지된 여러 Rule을 조회 할 수 있습니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">따라서, 시간에 따라 누적되는 사항은 없습니다.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">Action = log 상태에서는 해당 transaction에 대한 anomaly score에 누적되지 않습니다.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">4. DRS Block Action 동작 확인</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:black; background-color:yellow\">확인결과 DRS Action 종류가 Anomaly Score 기반 차단 외에도 &nbsp;Action=Block이 확인됩니다. 이 Block 동작이 무엇인지, CRS와 같이 즉시 차단 방식&#51004;로 동작 가능한지 확인 요청드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">→ Action : block 의 경우 anomaly score를 지원하지 않는 Rule을 통한 트래픽 차단을 적용하거나,</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">anomaly socre가 5를 초과하지 않더라도 해당 Rule에 의해 탐지된 트래픽은 즉시 차단하는 action입니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">혹시 이외 더 추가적&#51004;로 궁금하신 사항 있&#51004;시면</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">연락 부탁드리겠습니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">감사합니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><b>오승빈</b></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><b> Seung Bin Oh</b></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,113,194)\"><b>Azure Networking Technical Support </b></span><span style=\"font-f